{"synopsis":"Ini adalah bagian pertama dari adaptasi serial online terkenal! Lucu dan penuh lelucon, pasti akan menghibur pembaca! T: Siapa Fang Jipan? Pastor Jenderal: Dia anak saya yang hilang. terisak terisak; Kaisar: Setiap kali dia membuka mulutnya, kepalaku sakit; setiap kali dia mendekat, aku ingin lari. Pangeran: Dia satu-satunya penyebab kesengsaraan saya, dan alasan saya selalu dicaci maki. Fang Jipan: Hai teman-teman! Apakah kamu merindukan saya? Ayah Jenderal, Tuhan, Pangeran: Kita harus pergi sekarang!","alternative_title":"明朝败家子, The Prodigal Son of Ming Dynasty, Míng Cháo Bài Jiā Zi, Kẻ Ăn Hại Triều Minh","author":"Yueguan Baishao Comic Studio (关白勺漫画工作室)","artist":"Yuewen Manhua (阅文漫画)","chapters":[{"number":"104","chapter":"104","slug":"ac43e366-af65-4190-99e3-92cff1754875","title":"Chapter 104","date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"103","chapter":"103","slug":"3781b6c7-25b8-4fa4-9eff-f823c9eb7862","title":"Chapter 103","date":"2026-07-29"},{"number":"102","chapter":"102","slug":"367173e7-b0c6-4e24-b5e4-e4b112e4361d","title":"Chapter 102","date":"2026-07-21"},{"number":"101","chapter":"101","slug":"e7c08fca-0bb6-4008-8d7a-6d66945679d7","title":"Chapter 101","date":"2026-07-08"},{"number":"100","chapter":"100","slug":"e4af048a-cf59-4223-8420-e39b73978287","title":"Chapter 100","date":"2026-07-05"},{"number":"99","chapter":"99","slug":"b7fd0e42-4089-436f-b3d2-cb223edccb0a","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-07-01"},{"number":"98","chapter":"98","slug":"dcb8f928-485a-4d0f-8a8c-151fbd8a31e4","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-06-24"},{"number":"97","chapter":"97","slug":"3bdaf717-a173-4341-a7e0-f328a8a4c22e","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-06-17"},{"number":"96","chapter":"96","slug":"07e21a54-63b0-42c8-af1e-d97b27edacf1","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-06-14"},{"number":"95","chapter":"95","slug":"ddc5b48a-d203-45a0-a220-251418a7b00f","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-06-07"},{"number":"94","chapter":"94","slug":"c82b13ca-a069-47dd-91a4-0bf200a820d7","title